    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat continuously incoming monsters with various abilities!</h2><br>CriticalOrb is a 3D top-down shooting game. Choose various abilities to defeat the continuously incoming monsters until the boss appears! You need to become more critical before the boss arrives!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Starting Tips:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Prioritize selecting abilities such as &quot;Additional Projectiles,&quot; &quot;Penetration!&quot; and &quot;Roughly Sharp Thing&quot; for increased survivability and dealing more damage.<br></li><li>Unspecified probability-based rare abilities will trigger when the player's basic shots hit the enemies.<br></li><li>Pay attention to destructible objects scattered throughout the map! They might drop orbs providing beneficial effects!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Move the mouse<br></li><li>Press WASD<br></li><li>Press \u2191\u2190\u2192\u2193</li></ul>",
